<!--
  Real fixture (kind: real). Byte-identical copy, below this comment, of Anlage's
  spec/fixtures/opt/ProblemList.opt (sha256 of the unmodified source file:
  b821b98beebfba9e758cc0429a91bb98aedb7d50de684424f0eb58d51e4a47c1; introduced there
  in commit 7466c80, verified present as of anlage HEAD 706e4a73e9598b31b266097b9bf
  16ef3ed0b75c1, 2026-08-25; catalogued in anlage docs/demo/opt-catalog.md).
  Human-authored via Archetype Designer from CKM public archetypes (2026-08-22,
  frozen in anlage); language ja.

  Canonical source: Anlage (skoba/anlage) is the canonical origin of this fixture.
  This copy (issue #30) exists only so this repo's specs can exercise a real
  C_CODE_REFERENCE/referenceSetUri (value_set_binding,
  EVALUATION.problem_diagnosis.v1 at0002, ICD-11 MMS) alongside a local code_list
  (at0073) in one fixture -- if the two ever diverge, Anlage's copy at the commit
  cited above is authoritative; only this comment was prepended, the XML body below
  is unmodified.

  Do not confuse with the differently-sourced `demo_assets/templates/problem_list.opt`
  in this same repo: that one is English, dated 2024-02-16, "Generated By":
  "Archetype Designer v1.24.9 ... repositoryId=openehr-lesson", and has zero
  term_bindings/referenceSetUri -- a same-named but unrelated fixture, used by the
  demo app, not by this issue's specs.
-->
